- Enabled time selection in data plotting

* Thu Nov 23 2023 Miika Malin <miikasda@users.noreply.github.com> - 1.2.0-1
- Changed to semantic versioning
- Added an about page
- Added support for fullscreen plots
- Added a notification if Bluetooth is off when scanning for devices
- Added support for CSV exports
- Added support for selecting only a start or end time for plots
- Fixed negative temperature readings
- Made other small tweaks

* Tue Jul 04 2023 Miika Malin <miikasda@users.noreply.github.com> - 1.1-1
